abstract: Provides an extensible workflow for processing camera-trap data in Camtrap-DP
  format and automatically generating reproducible data-status and ecological reports.
  The package supports data-quality checks, ecological summaries, visualisations,
  maps, tables and modular report sections for wildlife-monitoring applications.
